          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The T&P valve opens at about 150 psi or 210°F so your tank never has to find out what happens beyond that. Test it once a year with a bucket under a proper discharge pipe, have it checked every few years, and treat any drip as a pressure, expansion, temperature or valve problem to be solved.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
